## 10. Standardized Lexicon & Taxonomy Glossary

| Term / Taxonomy | Category | Clear & Accessible Definition |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Hundred Refinement (*Bailian*)** | Refining | Purifying raw metal through repeated kinetic strikes to remove impurities and increase structural density. |
| **Thousand Refinement (*Qianlian*)** | Refining | Elevating metal beyond ordinary density into Thought Forging, establishing energetic resonance and nascent vitality. |
| **Spirit Refinement (*Lingduan*)** | Refining | Infusing soul power and personal life force to grant genuine life and primitive consciousness to metal. |
| **Soul Refinement (*Hunduan*)** | Refining | Elevating living metal to possess a genuine soul and bilateral communication with its creator. |
| **Heavenly Refinement (*Tianduan*)** | Refining | Guiding soul-refined metal through elemental lightning tribulation to achieve divine status. |
| **Blood Sacrifice (*Xianxue Jisi*)** | Tradition | Permanent energetic bonding of a practitioner's blood to their first thousand-refined tool. |
| **Harmony Rate (*Ronghe Lǜ*)** | Metallurgy | Percentage index measuring the structural and energetic integration between distinct metals in an alloy. |
